  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership building for Horticulture Value Addition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of the assignment is to identify key players that could be potential business partners for the stakeholders in the combi-track, to map and mobilise interest among downstream supply chain partners in the vegetable value chain and design together with these stakeholders and a group of smallholder growers a scalable and feasible model for collaboration through which value is added for all supply chain partners involved.</narrative>
  </description>
